r standing open among the stars.\n\n\n# **Three ways to chase a clock**\n\n**Timed Mode** \u2014 Solve against a depleting survival clock. Every correct placement buys back seconds; hesitation spends them.\n\n\n**Solo VS** \u2014 Race head-to-head against a rival ghost. No lobby, no queue, no waiting \u2014 your opponent is already on the board.\n\n**Grand Prix** \u2014 A championship event: multi-lap timed rival races, scored across the full run.", "short_description": "Every puzzle you solve restores a lost memory. Rebuild the seven memory-rooms of the Archive's first Archivist in a voice-narrated story campaign \u2014 then race your rival ghost through timed trials and Grand Prix championships. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://puzz.world/index.cfm?event=main.privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "i-Team", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://puzz.world/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28335915926092787"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974704_1631637507227260_573673291672040665_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n6b9DwCYxAsQ7kNvwE_CICr&_nc_oc=Adr4o1EKmWl9LP4GOEdpP7tRXZw_K-6OLZo39ZTtd8_OB91ayZYvhztnd2ljRNGKoX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scont